{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_clt_35_1","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_35","textTraditional":"一、六年，春，王三月，王人子突救衞。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_clt_35_2","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_35","textTraditional":"王人，卑者也。稱名，貴之也，善救衞也。救者善，則伐者不正矣。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_clt_35_3","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_35","textTraditional":"二、夏，六月，衞侯朔入於衞。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_clt_35_4","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_35","textTraditional":"其不言伐衞納朔何也？不逆天王之命也。入者，內弗受也。何用弗受也？為以王命絕之也。朔之名，惡也。朔入逆，則出順矣。朔出入名，以王命絕之也。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_clt_35_5","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_35","textTraditional":"三、秋，公至自伐衞。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_clt_35_6","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_35","textTraditional":"惡事不致，此其致何也？不致，則無用見公之惡，事之成也。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_clt_35_7","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_35","textTraditional":"四、螟。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_clt_35_8","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_35","textTraditional":"五、冬，齊人來歸衞寶。","sentenceOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_clt_35_9","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_35","textTraditional":"以齊首之，分惡於齊也。使之如下齊而來我然，惡戰則殺矣。","sentenceOrder":9}],"overrides":{}}